# Root .env is tracked: Lovable's published Vite build reads it. It may contain
# ONLY the public VITE_SUPABASE_URL and VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY values.
# All variants stay ignored and every .env* is excluded from source archives.
.env.*
!.env.example

# Transient planning file (historical .lovable/plan/ stays tracked)
.lovable/plan.md

# TypeScript build metadata
*.tsbuildinfo
